<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s014-3.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.2 계층적 하위 리소스"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s014-3.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s014-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1938, djr:R-1939 ;
    djr:text "\n부모-자식 관계에 슬래시를 사용한다. **3단계 이상 깊이는 피한다.**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s014-3.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s014-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```\nGET /customers/5/orders          # 고객 5의 주문 목록\nGET /customers/5/orders/10       # 고객 5의 주문 10\nGET /customers/5/orders/10/items # 3단계 — 허용하되 더 깊이는 피함\n```\n\n" .

