<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b18> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 18 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1951 ;
    djr:text "| 500 | Internal Server Error | 서버 문제. 애매하면 500 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b19> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 19 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1952 ;
    djr:text "| 503 | Service Unavailable | 일시 과부하/정비. Retry-After 헤더 가능 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 코드 | 의미 | API 용도 |\n|------|------|----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b20> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 20 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1953, djr:R-1954, djr:R-1955 ;
    djr:text "**낙관적 동시성/CAS 재시도 루프의 *소진*도 경계 실패 모드다**: 유한 재시도 루프를 설계하면 '재시도 상한 초과(쓰기 경합 미해소)'는 happy-path 밖이지만 *경계로 관찰되는* 결과다 — status 표에서 누락하지 말고 **재시도 가능(retryable) status를 배정**한다(승인된 `Retry-After`를 가진 503 또는 409 — 둘 다 정당, 선택은 멱등성·재시도 UX 트레이드오프로 §5/G1). `Retry-After`를 공개하는 경우 §5.4의 경계에 따라 controller가 그 헤더를 소유한다. *어느 쪽이든 표에서 누락 금지*가 의무이고 둘 중 선택은 설계자가 임의 확정하지 않는다(미매핑 시 기본 500 누수).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1940 ;
    djr:text "| 200 | OK | GET, PUT, PATCH 성공 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
