    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1943 ;
    djr:text "| 204 | No Content | DELETE 성공. 응답 본문 없음 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "**클라이언트 오류 (4xx):**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "| 코드 | 의미 | API 용도 |\n|------|------|----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s018-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1944 ;
    djr:text "| 400 | Bad Request | 잘못된 요청 형식, 유효성 검증 실패 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s019-4.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.3 PRG (POST/Redirect/GET) 패턴"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s019-4.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s019-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1956 ;
    djr:text "\nPOST 주문 후 303으로 GET 결과 페이지로 리다이렉트하여 새로고침 시 중복 주문 방지.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s019-4.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s019-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: Go_Deeper/Wiki/Http/StatusCode, RFC 9110\n\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s020-5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 5. 요청/응답 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s020-5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s020-5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1957 ;
    djr:text "\nAPI 계약은 URL과 메서드만이 아니라 요청 본문, 응답 본문, 상태 코드, 헤더, 에러 형식의 조합이다. 클라이언트가 의존할 수 있는 항목은 명시적으로 기록한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.1 요청 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1958 ;
    djr:text "\n- 필수 필드와 선택 필드를 구분한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1959 ;
    djr:text "- 필드 타입, 형식, 단위, 허용 범위, 기본값을 명시한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1960, djr:R-1961 ;
    djr:text "- 외부 식별자·수치 입력의 허용 범위에는 도메인/스토리지 *상한*도 포함한다(하한만 두지 말 것) — 미설정 시 거대 입력이 스토리지 오버플로로 500이 되어 클라이언트 입력 오류(400/422 클래스)가 5xx로 오분류된다. 상한 *값*은 필드·DB 타입에 맞춰 정하고 구체 경계값(매직넘버)은 이 계약 계층에 박지 않는다(implementation에 위임)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1962 ;
    djr:text "- query parameter는 필터링, 정렬, 검색, sparse fieldset, pagination처럼 조회 표현을 조정하는 데 사용한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1963 ;
    djr:text "- 비밀 값이나 인증 정보는 query parameter에 넣지 않는다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1964 ;
    djr:text "- `POST`는 생성 또는 non-idempotent action 요청 본문을 명확히 정의하고, duplicate-sensitive 요청은 `Idempotency-Key` 정책을 함께 정한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1965 ;
    djr:text "- `PUT`은 전체 교체 계약이므로 누락 필드가 어떻게 처리되는지 명시한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1966 ;
    djr:text "- `PATCH`는 patch document 형식과 idempotent 여부를 별도로 판단한다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.2 응답 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1967 ;
    djr:text "\n- 상태 코드별 응답 본문 존재 여부와 schema를 분리해 정의한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1968 ;
    djr:text "- `201 Created`는 가능한 경우 `Location` 헤더로 새 자원 URI를 제공한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1969 ;
    djr:text "- `202 Accepted`는 작업 접수 응답과 결과 확인 방법을 함께 제공한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1970 ;
    djr:text "- `204 No Content`는 응답 본문이 없다는 점을 계약으로 둔다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1971 ;
    djr:text "- 오류 응답은 선택한 에러 프로필의 media type·필드·상태 코드별 schema를 문서화한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1972 ;
    djr:text "- 캐시, rate limit, retry, deprecation, idempotency replay처럼 클라이언트 동작을 바꾸는 헤더는 응답 계약에 포함한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3467 ;
    djr:text "- 한 상태 코드의 성공 본문이 둘 이상의 모양이면 판별 필드(discriminator)를 가진 **이름 붙은 schema 하나**(`oneOf` + `discriminator`)로 계약한다 — 익명 `anyOf` 는 클라이언트가 분기할 이름과 판별 키를 잃는다. 오류 본문의 union 은 각 오류 schema 가 고정 공개 식별자(code 프로필의 `<Bc>ErrorCode` 값 · RFC 9457 의 `type`)로 자기 판별되므로 이 요구의 대상이 아니다(§5.4 에러 프로필)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.3 계약 체크리스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1973 ;
    djr:text "\n엔드포인트를 설계하거나 변경할 때 다음을 함께 검토한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "| OpenAPI | path/method/schema/response/security/header 반영 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: Microsoft REST API Design, Google API Design Guide, RFC 9110, OpenAPI Initiative\n\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 항목 | 확인 내용 |\n|------|-----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| Resource | 클라이언트가 식별하는 자원과 URI |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| Method | 안전성, 멱등성, 생성/교체/부분 수정/삭제 의미 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "| Request | body/query/path/header 필드와 validation |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "| Response | 상태 코드별 body/header/schema |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "| Error | 선택한 에러 프로필, status별 body/header/schema, public code 또는 RFC type |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "| Auth | authentication/authorization 요구사항 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "| Compatibility | breaking change 여부와 version/deprecation 필요성 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.4 에러 프로필 선택"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1974 ;
    djr:text "\n에러 wire contract는 다음 우선순위로 하나를 선택한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1975 ;
    djr:text "1. 이미 배포된 API의 에러 계약이 있으면 그 계약을 보존한다. `WWW-Authenticate`나 `Retry-After`처럼 이미 공개된 헤더도 이 계약의 일부이며, 프레임워크 기본 응답과의 차이는 별도 설계로 다룬다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1976 ;
    djr:text "2. 새 dddjango Django Ninja 범위는 기본으로 `dddjango-code-json`을 선택한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1977 ;
    djr:text "3. RFC 9457은 외부 표준, 기존 소비자, 또는 별도 요구가 있을 때만 선택한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1978, djr:R-1979 ;
    djr:text "한 API 범위 안에서는 RFC 프로필과 code 프로필의 wire 필드를 섞지 않는다. 특히 code 프로필에 `type`, `about:blank`, URI 요구사항이나 `application/problem+json`을 끼워 넣지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1980, djr:R-1981, djr:R-1982, djr:R-1983, djr:R-1984 ;
    djr:text "이 절이 고르는 것은 **wire 계약**(필드 집합·media type)이지 구현 형태가 아니며, 이 문단의 주어는 **신규 범위**(②·③으로 wire 프로필을 새로 고르는 산출물)다 — preserve-established(우선순위 ①) 범위는 native 메커니즘 보존이 관할이라(12-slot 계약 소유) 이 문단의 대상이 아니고, 확립 native 구현·배선을 표준 레시피로 옮길 근거가 되지 않는다. 이때 preserve-established **범위**의 보존 대상은 이미 배포된 표면·계약이다 — 신규 endpoint가 확립 namespace에 합류하는 사실은 wire 보존(①)의 근거일 뿐 신규 endpoint의 구현 스택·컨트롤러 형태의 근거가 아니고(형태·스택은 G1 스택 결정과 구현 스킬 소유), 신규 표면이 preserve wire 를 지는 조합의 게이트 취급 역시 뒤의 미열거 조합 조항대로 G1 에서 표면화한다(STOP). 신규 범위는 ③으로 RFC 9457 wire 를 선택해도 표준 controller 레시피(controller 소유·좁은 try·`bc_error_schema.py`·직접 `Status` 반환 — 레시피의 정본은 구현 스킬·검사기 계약이고 이 절은 wire 만 소유한다)로 구현한다: **«RFC 9457 wire + 표준 레시피»는 wire 규칙상 모순이 아니다**(2026-08-13 — 스팩이 이 조합을 표현하려 프로필 «이름»을 차용해 문면 모순이 된 사례 반영). 단 **G2 게이트·12-slot 의 profile 표기는 현재 `dddjango-code-json | preserve-established` 두 값뿐**이라 이 조합의 게이트 취급은 아직 열거에 없다 — 채택하려면 그 취급 결정을 G1 에서 표면화하라(STOP 대상이며, 스팩·플러그인 문면이 실제로 충돌하는 경우도 여전히 STOP 대상이다)(G1/G2=파이프라인의 설계/구현 승인 게이트 · 12-slot=오류 계약 기록표 `Error response contract 12-slot` · STOP=`STOP_FOR_USER_APPROVAL` — 사용자 결정으로만 진행). 위 혼합 금지의 주어는 wire 필드다 — 구현 레시피를 프로필의 일부로 읽지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### `dddjango-code-json` (새 dddjango Ninja 범위의 기본)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1985 ;
    djr:text "\n- media type은 `application/json`이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1986, djr:R-1987 ;
    djr:text "- 플러그인이 정한 body property 목록은 없다. 기존 범위는 관찰된 exact 오류 schema shape를 보존하고, 신규 범위는 exact field set·type·required/default·nullable·Field metadata·model config/legacy Config·validator/serializer/computed field/Pydantic hook inventory와 effective semantics·wire 직렬화를 일반 G1 승인과 분리해 명시 승인받는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1988, djr:R-1989 ;
    djr:text "- 기준선 shape의 property 추가·삭제·이름·타입·존재성·변환 규칙·의미 변경은 일반 기능 승인이 아니라 별도 public contract 변경이다. 호환성 영향과 server/client/test 전환 범위를 보여 준 뒤 명시적 사용자 승인을 받는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1990, djr:R-1991, djr:R-1992 ;
    djr:text "- 승인 shape의 한 공통 필드를 BC `ErrorCode(StrEnum)`으로 좁혀 안정적인 공개 식별자를 제공한다. 그 필드명은 고정하지 않는다. public하게 구별되거나 관찰 가능한 실패에만 값을 부여하며, 여러 내부 예외는 하나의 public 식별자로 합쳐질 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1993, djr:R-1994, djr:R-1995 ;
    djr:text "- HTTP status 계약은 body property의 존재를 요구하거나 가정하지 않는다. 승인 shape에 status field가 있으면 실제 HTTP status와 일치시켜야 하지만, 그런 field가 없으면 controller의 literal/status 상수가 계약을 소유한다. 공개 문자열은 `str(exc)`를 자동 사용하거나 민감한 내부 정보를 누설하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1996, djr:R-1997, djr:R-1998 ;
    djr:text "- 배포된 public 식별자의 변경은 breaking change다. 한 클라이언트 Enum은 하나의 계약을 소비한다. 실제 클라이언트 migration은 별도 작업이지만, 12-slot rollout에는 동시 전환인지 version split인지 기록한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s025> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1999 ;
    djr:text "- framework-owned 401/403, route 404, 422, 429, `HttpError`, 500의 기본 응답은 이 code 계약의 body가 아니며, 그 본문이 정확하고 안정적인 공개 계약이라고 주장하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### framework 기본 응답과 공개 헤더의 경계"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2000, djr:R-2001, djr:R-2002 ;
    djr:text "\n프레임워크 기본 401/403/route 404/422/429/`HttpError`/500을 전역 handler나 helper로 BC body로 바꾸어 헤더를 합성하지 않는다. 확립된 계약이 401의 `WWW-Authenticate` 또는 429의 `Retry-After`를 요구하면 그 헤더는 보존하고 별도 설계한다. presentation controller가 직접 공개하는 retryable BC 오류는 승인된 `Retry-After` 헤더를 그 controller가 소유한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s027-6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 6. RFC 9457 에러 응답 형식"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s027-6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s027-6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2003, djr:R-2004, djr:R-2005 ;
    djr:text "\n이 절은 §5.4에서 RFC 9457 프로필을 선택한 API 범위에만 적용한다. `dddjango-code-json` 범위에는 적용하지 않는다. (wire 형식의 절이다 — 신규 RFC 범위의 구현 형태는 §5.4 마지막 문단의 단서를 따른다.)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s029-6.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.2 예시"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s029-6.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s029-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```json\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\nContent-Type: application/problem+json\n\n{\n  \"type\": \"https://example.com/probs/out-of-credit\",\n  \"title\": \"You do not have enough credit.\",\n  \"status\": 403,\n  \"detail\": \"Your current balance is 30, but that costs 50.\",\n  \"instance\": \"/account/12345/msgs/abc\",\n  \"balance\": 30,\n  \"accounts\": [\"/account/12345\", \"/account/67890\"]\n}\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s029-6.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s029-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2006 ;
    djr:text "`balance`와 `accounts`는 **확장 필드**. 문제 유형 정의에서 추가 가능. 클라이언트는 인식하지 못하는 확장 필드를 무시해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.3 핵심 규칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2007 ;
    djr:text "\n- `type`은 문서화 역할을 하는 안정적 URI\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2008 ;
    djr:text "- `title`은 **유형**(재사용), `detail`은 **특정 발생**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2009 ;
    djr:text "- RFC 프로필을 선택한 API 범위의 공개 에러 응답에 이 형식을 일관되게 적용\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s030-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: IETF RFC 9457\n\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 7.2 콘텐츠 협상 (Content Negotiation)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "7.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n클라이언트가 선호하는 표현을 요청하는 방식.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "| 상황 | 상태 코드 | 의미 |\n|------|----------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2010 ;
    djr:text "| 서버가 Accept/Accept-* 를 만족하는 표현을 만들 수 없음 (응답 측) | `406 Not Acceptable` | 가용 표현 특성 목록을 본문에 제공하거나, 정책상 기본 표현으로 대체 응답할 수 있다 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2011 ;
    djr:text "| 요청 본문의 Content-Type/Content-Encoding을 이 메서드·리소스가 지원하지 않음 (요청 측) | `415 Unsupported Media Type` | 서버가 요청 페이로드 형식을 처리할 수 없어 거절한다 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2012 ;
    djr:text "406은 **응답** 표현을 협상하지 못한 경우, 415는 **요청** 페이로드 형식을 받아들이지 못한 경우다. 둘을 혼동하지 않는다. (RFC 9110 §15.5.7, §15.5.16)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2013, djr:R-2014, djr:R-2015, djr:R-2016 ;
    djr:text "> `406`/`415` 계약이 별도 승인된 범위에서만 `implementation-django-ninja` §6.3을 따른다. 사용 중인 Django Ninja 버전과 presentation 스타일에 맞는, 검증된 Ninja-owned pre-body 경계에서 framework `HttpError` 흐름을 사용한다. 특히 parser 예외는 버전에 따라 다른 status로 정규화될 수 있으므로 실제 응답이 415인지 확인한다. 전역 middleware/helper/handler로 status나 body를 합성하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 요청 헤더 | 협상 대상 |\n|----------|----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| Accept | 미디어 타입 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| Accept-Language | 자연 언어 |\n" .

