    djr:text "**Quality Values (q값)**: 0~1 사이 값으로 우선순위 지정. 생략 시 1.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s033-7.2> ;
