    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "**협상 실패 시 상태 코드**:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.1 인증 vs 인가"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n| 구분 | 인증 (Authentication) | 인가 (Authorization) |\n|------|---------------------|---------------------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 질문 | \"너는 누구인가?\" | \"너는 이걸 할 수 있는가?\" |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| 시점 | 인가보다 먼저 | 인증 후에 수행 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| HTTP 코드 | 401 Unauthorized | 403 Forbidden |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b8> ;
    djr:text "| 실패 시 | 서버가 401을 생성하면 적용 가능한 `WWW-Authenticate` challenge를 보냄 | 권한 부족 메시지 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "- 인증이 있어야 인가가 있다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "- 401은 이름이 Unauthorized지만 실제로는 **인증(Authentication)** 오류다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2017 ;
    djr:text "- **RFC 9110 규칙**: 서버가 401 응답을 생성하면 적용 가능한 `WWW-Authenticate` challenge를 반드시 보낸다. 이것은 에러 body 프로필과 별개의 HTTP 의미론이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2018, djr:R-2019 ;
    djr:text "- **구현/프로필 경계**: 테스트한 Django Ninja 기본 401은 이 challenge를 제공하지 않을 수 있다. 이미 배포되었거나 공개적으로 요구된 계약은 challenge를 보존하고, 기본 동작과 맞지 않으면 G1에서 별도 설계로 되돌린다. code-profile body를 강제하려고 전역 handler나 helper로 challenge를 합성하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.2 인증 메커니즘 선택 기준"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n| 방식 | 적합 | 특징 |\n|------|------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2020 ;
    djr:text "| **API Key** | 서버 간 통신, 내부 API | 단순, 사용자 식별 불가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2021 ;
    djr:text "| **OAuth 2.0** | 서드파티 접근 권한 위임 | 표준화, 복잡하지만 유연 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s037-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2022 ;
    djr:text "| **JWT (Bearer Token)** | 무상태 인증, 마이크로서비스 | 자체 포함(self-contained), 만료 관리 필요 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.3 API 요청의 보안 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b5> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2023 ;
    djr:text "\n- **비밀 정보를 쿼리 파라미터에 담지 않는다** — URL은 서버/프록시 로그에 기록됨\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2024 ;
    djr:text "- 인증 정보는 `Authorization` 헤더에 전달\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2025 ;
    djr:text "- 모든 API 통신에 HTTPS 사용\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s038-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: Go_Deeper/Wiki/Http/StatusCode, Go_Deeper/Wiki/OAuth, Go_Deeper/Book/Architecture/DesigningAPIS\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.4 토큰 수명과 스코프"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2026, djr:R-2027 ;
    djr:text "\nBearer 토큰(OAuth 2.0/JWT)을 쓰면 만료와 권한 범위를 계약으로 명시한다. 401을 생성하는 Bearer 서버는 §8.1의 RFC 9110 challenge 규칙을 지키며, 다음은 그 challenge가 포함하는 Bearer 계약의 표면이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 상황 | 상태 코드 | WWW-Authenticate | 의미 |\n|------|----------|------------------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2028 ;
    djr:text "| 토큰 만료·폐기·변조 (`invalid_token`) | `401 Unauthorized` | `Bearer error=\"invalid_token\"` | 재인증하거나 refresh로 새 토큰을 발급받는다 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2029 ;
    djr:text "| 토큰은 유효하나 권한 범위 부족 (`insufficient_scope`) | `403 Forbidden` | `Bearer error=\"insufficient_scope\", scope=\"...\"` | 필요한 scope를 응답에 안내할 수 있다 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b8>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s036-8.1/b9> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2030, djr:R-2031, djr:R-2032, djr:R-2033 ;
    djr:text "- 토큰 만료는 401이며 인증(§8.1) 실패다. 서버가 이 401을 생성하면 `WWW-Authenticate` challenge로 인증 방법과 오류 원인을 안내한다. 이미 배포되었거나 공개적으로 요구된 Bearer 계약의 challenge는 보존하고, 테스트한 Django Ninja 기본 401이 제공하지 못하는 차이는 G1에서 별도 설계한다. 프레임워크 기본 401에 전역 handler나 helper로 이 헤더를 합성하여 code-profile body를 강제하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2034, djr:R-2035 ;
    djr:text "- scope는 토큰이 허용하는 작업 범위다. 엔드포인트가 요구하는 scope와 토큰의 scope를 비교해 부족하면 403 + `insufficient_scope`로 응답하고, 확립된 Bearer 계약이 정하면 필요한 scope를 헤더로 알린다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2036, djr:R-2037 ;
    djr:text "- 토큰 수명, refresh 흐름, scope 집합은 API 계약으로 고정한다. 토큰 검증·발급의 구체 구현은 인증 라이브러리/프레임워크가 담당한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s039-8.4> ;
