    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.1 Breaking vs Non-Breaking Change"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n| 변경 유형 | Breaking? | 예시 |\n|----------|:---------:|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2055 ;
    djr:text "| 에러 형식 변경 | **O** | 에러 응답 구조 변경 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2047 ;
    djr:text "| 필드 추가 (응답) | X | 새 필드 `created_at` 추가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2048 ;
    djr:text "| 필드 추가 (요청, 선택) | X | 선택적 파라미터 `filter` 추가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2049 ;
    djr:text "| 필드 제거 | **O** | 기존 `name` 필드 삭제 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2050 ;
    djr:text "| 필드 이름 변경 | **O** | `name` → `full_name` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2051 ;
    djr:text "| 필드 타입 변경 | **O** | `id: int` → `id: string` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2052 ;
    djr:text "| 필수 파라미터 추가 | **O** | 새 필수 필드 `email` 추가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2053 ;
    djr:text "| URL 경로 변경 | **O** | `/users` → `/accounts` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2054 ;
    djr:text "| 상태 코드 변경 | **O** | 200 → 201 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.2 Deprecation 프로세스"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2056 ;
    djr:text "\n1. **Deprecation 공지**: API 문서에 명시, 변경 이력에 기록\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2057 ;
    djr:text "2. **Sunset 헤더**: 응답에 만료 날짜 포함\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "   ```\n   Sunset: Sat, 01 Mar 2025 00:00:00 GMT\n   Deprecation: true\n   ```\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2058 ;
    djr:text "3. **마이그레이션 기간**: 최소 6개월~1년 유지\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2059 ;
    djr:text "4. **대체 API 안내**: 새 엔드포인트 또는 버전으로의 마이그레이션 가이드 제공\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2060 ;
    djr:text "5. **제거**: 마이그레이션 기간 종료 후 제거\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.3 실전 원칙"@ko ;
