    djr:sectionNumber "11.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2061 ;
    djr:text "\n- **추가는 자유, 제거는 금지** (Additive changes only)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2062 ;
    djr:text "- Breaking change가 필요하면 새 버전을 만든다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2063 ;
    djr:text "- 클라이언트가 인식하지 못하는 필드를 무시하도록 설계 (Robustness Principle: \"보내는 것은 엄격하게, 받는 것은 관대하게\")\n\n"@ko .

