    djr:text "| **Sliding Window** | 부드러움, 경계 문제 없음 | 정확한 제어 필요 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s055-12.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
