    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2068 ;
    djr:text "\n- 비용 큰 작업(인증, DB) **전에** rate limit 검사\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s056-12.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s056-12.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s026/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2069, djr:R-2070 ;
    djr:text "- 확립된 429 계약의 `Retry-After` 헤더는 보존한다. 프레임워크 기본 429에 전역적으로 헤더를 합성하지 않으며, presentation controller가 직접 공개하는 retryable BC 오류만 승인된 `Retry-After` 헤더를 그 controller가 소유한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s056-12.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
