    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2071 ;
    djr:text "- Rate limit 정책을 API 문서에 명확히 기재\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s056-12.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
