<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.2 Idempotency-Key 패턴"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```\nPOST /v1/charges\nIdempotency-Key: KG5LxSFa3M4fcVng\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\"amount\": 2000, \"currency\": \"usd\"}\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "**동작 방식**:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2072 ;
    djr:text "1. 클라이언트가 고유 키 생성 (V4 UUID 권장)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b10> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2073, djr:R-2074 ;
    djr:text "2. 서버가 첫 요청의 결과를 저장 — 도메인 outcome은 응용 계층(트랜잭션)이 저장하고, HTTP status·응답 표현은 presentation이 소유한다(application·domain은 status를 만들지 않는다; §13.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2075 ;
    djr:text "3. 동일 키의 후속 요청은 저장된 결과를 반환\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2076 ;
    djr:text "4. 키는 24시간 후 만료 (일반적 정책)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s059-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2077 ;
    djr:text "5. POST에만 적용 — GET, PUT, DELETE는 이미 멱등\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.3 계약 결정 사항"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2078 ;
    djr:text "\n`Idempotency-Key`를 받는 엔드포인트는 다음을 API 계약으로 정한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2082, djr:R-2083, djr:R-2084, djr:R-2085, djr:R-2086 ;
    djr:text "Replay는 현재 자원 상태를 다시 조회해 새 응답을 만드는 것이 아니라, 최초 처리 outcome을 재현하는 것이다. 생성된 자원이 이후 바뀔 수 있다면 최초 응답 snapshot 또는 이에 준하는 안정적인 결과를 보관한다. 멱등성 저장은 도메인/응용 outcome을 트랜잭션에 기록하고, owning presentation controller가 최초·replay outcome을 HTTP status와 선택한 프로필의 응답 표현으로 매핑한다. 그 매핑을 중앙 error handler가 소유하지 않으며, application·domain은 status를 catch·생성·저장하지 않는다. byte 단위로 동일한 replay가 계약상 필요하면 presentation이 렌더한 응답을 보관하되, status 결정 소유는 여전히 presentation이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2087, djr:R-2088, djr:R-2089 ;
    djr:text "**요청 fingerprint로 충돌 판정**: \"동일 key, 다른 request content\"를 판정하려면, 최초 요청 페이로드에서 생성한 fingerprint(예: 본문 hash)를 key와 함께 저장하고 후속 요청의 fingerprint와 비교한다. 일치하면 replay, 불일치하면 충돌이다. IETF Idempotency-Key 초안은 fingerprint 불일치(다른 페이로드)에는 `422 Unprocessable Content` + 문서 링크(`Link` 헤더)를, 처리 중인 최초 요청과 겹친 동시 재시도(아래 Concurrency)에는 `409 Conflict`를 권고한다. 일부 구현(Stripe 등)은 불일치에 `409`/`400`을 쓰기도 한다. 선택한 프로필의 public code 또는 RFC Problem Details를 계약에 명시한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 항목 | 기준 |\n|------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| 적용 여부 | endpoint가 key를 허용하는지, 필수로 요구하는지 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| Key scope | caller, operation, tenant, resource owner 등 어떤 범위에서 unique한지 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2079 ;
    djr:text "| Replay | 동일 key와 동일 request는 최초 operation outcome을 재현하고, 선택한 에러 프로필에 맞는 HTTP 응답으로 매핑 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2080 ;
    djr:text "| Conflict | 동일 key와 다른 request content는 새 작업으로 처리하지 않고 충돌로 응답 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "| Retention | key와 최초 결과를 얼마 동안 보관하는지 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "| Concurrency | 같은 key의 동시 요청 race를 어떻게 직렬화하거나 거절하는지 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2081 ;
    djr:text "| Storage | 내구성 있는 저장소와 transaction/lock 정책은 DB 설계로 연결 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.4 실전 원칙"@ko ;
