    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2090, djr:R-2091 ;
    djr:text "\n- 결제, 주문 생성 등 **중복이 치명적인 POST**에 필수(dddjango 파이프라인: 채택은 G0/G1 사용자 결정이다 — 미요청이면 기본 미적용·설계가 G1 에서 제안만 한다)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2092 ;
    djr:text "- 멱등성 키를 내구성 있는 저장소(DB, Redis)에 보관\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2093 ;
    djr:text "- 동일 키의 동시 요청에 대한 레이스 컨디션 처리 필요\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s060-13.3/b11> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2094 ;
    djr:text "- 동일 key와 다른 request content(fingerprint 불일치)는 충돌로 처리한다 — status(`422`/`409` 등)와 선택한 에러 프로필을 계약에서 고른다(§13.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2095 ;
    djr:text "- browser form resubmission이 주된 문제이면 PRG를 고려하고, API client retry가 주된 문제이면 `Idempotency-Key`를 우선한다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s061-13.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
