    djr:text "> 출처: Stripe API - Idempotent Requests, Stripe Blog - Idempotency, IETF Draft - Idempotency-Key\n\n---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-api/references/final.md/s065-14.3> a djr:Section ;
